    <briefdescription>
<para>NOT(value) - Logical NOT operation (Excel-compatible). </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Inverts the truthiness of a value or all elements in an array.</para>
<para>Examples: NOT(true) =&gt; false NOT(false) =&gt; true NOT(0) =&gt; true NOT([true, false, true]) =&gt; [false, true, false] </para>
    </detaileddescription>
